Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.24,0:00:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The formidable Giri Double Six once\Nconquered the North Blue by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.84,0:00:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe\Nthat tomorrow your regime
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,of terror abruptly ends\Nwith a hail of bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.78,0:00:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The wedding will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Soaked red with your blood. Bang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I would\Nappreciate one last favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.82,0:00:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you make it a point not to create\Ntoo big of a mess when you die tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.00,0:00:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just be mindful of the splatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.14,0:00:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If that wedding cake gets\None drop of blood on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.94,0:00:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama will be livid and no one wants that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.50,0:00:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She'd tear the place down out of fury.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.96,0:01:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,See this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.32,0:01:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a 36-caliber Walker\NPercussion Pistol.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.92,0:01:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The bullets it fires are\Ncalled Candy Jackets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.18,0:01:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They are designed to be able to penetrate\Nthrough the toughest armor and shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.90,0:01:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see, it works rather well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.66,0:01:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Even your tempered body\Ncan be pierced by these.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.54,0:01:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you imagine Sanji's face\Nwhen he sees the girl he trusted?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.34,0:01:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Pointing a gun right between his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.46,0:01:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.38,0:01:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be good!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.26,0:01:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That sad sack actually believes\Nthat you have real feelings for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.34,0:01:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't suspect a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.00,0:01:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The poor fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.40,0:01:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of face he'll make?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.52,0:02:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.86,0:02:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.00,0:02:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They really nailed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.68,0:02:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.04,0:02:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Or how about this one? Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.42,0:02:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,P-p-pudding, my sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, why aren't you looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.18,0:02:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.14,0:02:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't like us making fun of your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.32,0:02:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Live a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.62,0:02:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing can take the edge off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.34,0:02:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Got nothing to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.78,0:02:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to know how he proposed?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.84,0:02:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It was hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.30,0:02:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and pretty embarrassing, honestly,\Nhe pulled his face back off,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.84,0:02:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and his whole head was fat and bloated.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.06,0:02:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and ugly—it was too easy in\Nthat moment of vulnerability;
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.54,0:02:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,all I had to do was fake some tears,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.98,0:03:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and he was putty if you decide to\Nmarry me—I won't let it be hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.12,0:03:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,be hell
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.04,0:03:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, men are stupid creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.14,0:03:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that fool pulled me close,\Njust like in a Clutch romance novel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.38,0:03:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And uttered some trash\Nin this soft whisper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.92,0:03:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my salvation, pudding!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.14,0:03:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you'll have me, let's get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.22,0:03:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, could you imagine\Na more pitiful proposal?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.62,0:04:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a riot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.80,0:04:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of idiot would win a\Ncolossal failure like him? Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.64,0:04:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The nerve of you, trying to pass him off?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.22,0:04:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,At least bring me a\Nproper Prince to marry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.82,0:04:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.82,0:05:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope that we'll never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.26,0:05:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting bones,\Nwe'll reach it, we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.12,0:05:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so truly grateful I ran into\Nyou on that day so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.92,0:06:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We laughed every moment with tears in\Nour eyes till we knew we weren't alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.62,0:06:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The blowing wind came in\Nand joined us on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.30,0:06:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And with it I know we'll rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.30,0:06:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be flying up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.02,0:06:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why are you giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.58,0:06:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why you want to fight alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.96,0:06:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what kind of future\Ndo you think you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.90,0:06:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dream is already in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.42,0:06:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn off forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.14,0:06:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.98,0:06:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And no matter where you\Nare, nothing needs truth on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.10,0:06:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting plans,\Nwe'll reach it, we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.84,0:06:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,From the horizon, out on\Nthe edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.70,0:06:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If there was a place that\NI'd want to take you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.70,0:06:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head for it then, but ask\Nfor the way we already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.62,0:06:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.48,0:07:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You scream by your voice that\Ncan't break through the silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.46,0:07:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling defeated, it\Ncrushes your helpless heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.26,0:07:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got your back, I\Nswear, I'll always be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.40,0:07:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put our fate within\Nthis light under the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.98,0:07:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you close your eyes and\Njust listen to my voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.02,0:07:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find the answer\Ntogether, I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.68,0:07:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,In our path I trust that it will lead us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.82,0:07:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,To another sea untarded,\Ncause now we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.54,0:07:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,On the horizon, out on\Nthe edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.42,0:07:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a place that I wanna take you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.36,0:07:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head forward then,\Nbut ask for the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.20,0:07:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.26,0:07:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.28,0:08:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still trying to stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.36,0:08:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.38,0:08:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why hurt yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.44,0:08:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You must really want another\Nthrashing, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.46,0:08:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You want that stone so badly, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.90,0:08:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not trying to rescue Sanji,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.18,0:08:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,leaving him and focusing on the\Npolyglyph instead. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.78,0:08:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one thing about\NSanji; he's kind to a fault,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.66,0:08:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,so I thought right from the start\Nthat he might not be returning to our
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.80,0:08:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,crew—that isn't to say I've figured out\Nexactly what trap you've set for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.74,0:08:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But knowing Sanji's considerate nature,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.14,0:08:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,if he's made up his mind to\Nsacrifice himself for someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.14,0:08:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,then he will not back down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.58,0:08:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Our captain on the other\Nhand will follow his
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.64,0:09:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,heart fearlessly and see\Nthis through to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.88,0:09:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So I have faith in the both of\Nthem to settle things on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.90,0:09:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.26,0:09:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,all up to them then—you're useless,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.46,0:09:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,just coming to play with my poneglyph\Nbecause you're bored, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.66,0:09:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If worse comes to worst and Sanji\Ndecides to stay here of his own accord?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.06,0:09:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,own accord
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.64,0:09:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not want him to\Nbe riddled with guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.58,0:09:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.49,0:09:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I want him to know that this journey allowed\Nus to accomplish something essential.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.62,0:09:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So I must succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.64,0:09:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That Poneglyph's message is ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.46,0:09:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.26,0:09:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that your idea of\Nworst-case scenario is rather tame.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.20,0:09:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji staying behind,\Nthat's the worst outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.50,0:09:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.58,0:09:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Has the thought even crossed your\Nmind that everyone might die?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.54,0:10:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a fool would include his own\Ndeath as part of a plan, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.16,0:10:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.70,0:10:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Tickle, tickle, tickle!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.42,0:10:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer the question and I'll stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.00,0:10:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, it's more of Carrot's\Nspecial tickle, tickle, tickle!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.10,0:10:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't! I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.84,0:10:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take it, you little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just spit it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.90,0:10:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,She can do this all day! Don't try her!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.86,0:10:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.77,0:10:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll tell!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.69,0:10:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard her, Carrot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.84,0:10:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You can stop, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.50,0:10:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you pay
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.78,0:10:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So where is it then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.76,0:10:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one's the castle's entrance?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.58,0:10:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you honestly think that I can remember\Nwhere every single mirror leads to?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.82,0:11:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the answer we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.70,0:11:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You just gotta ask the mirrors themselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.82,0:11:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Like talk to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.42,0:11:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.68,0:11:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.66,0:11:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask the stupid things yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.76,0:11:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,All the mirrors know\Nwhat they're reflecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.64,0:11:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Magic mirrors in the hall!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.14,0:11:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one leads us to\Nthe castle wall? Not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.12,0:11:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Also me! I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.52,0:11:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Me as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.28,0:11:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They actually answered us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.42,0:11:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can assist with that! I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.82,0:11:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take you there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.06,0:11:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can transport you\Ninto Lady Galant's closet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.64,0:11:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a hand mirror in a guest\Nroom on the second floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.44,0:11:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got ladies room\Nfor a floor over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.04,0:11:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Are any of you reflecting our buddies\NLuffy, Nambi, Brooke, Pedro, or Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.28,0:11:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's who we're looking for!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.28,0:11:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.50,0:11:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What do they look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.96,0:12:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I caught a glimpse of Sanji earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.52,0:12:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.36,0:12:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't know what\Neverybody looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.60,0:12:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Count on me, Cho-Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.06,0:12:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a pretty good artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.70,0:12:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.50,0:12:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.52,0:12:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,it must be embarrassing to have such\Na dim-witted brother yeah he's so dumb
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.18,0:12:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,hey uh it looks like a little hostage is\Ngonna pass out soon if she croaks that'll
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.16,0:12:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,ruin our whole plan and that won't do we
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.20,0:12:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,still want her to attend\Ntomorrow's ceremony
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.58,0:12:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,me listen close dear sister-in-law i
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.32,0:12:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,can't have you bleeding\Nto death on us and i
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.08,0:12:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,certainly don't want to risk you ratting
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.92,0:13:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,on me for all my\Nunladylike behavior tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.24,0:13:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.46,0:13:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.16,0:13:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.00,0:13:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.42,0:13:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't so bad, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.26,0:14:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone carries unpleasant memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.76,0:14:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and trauma we'd rather forget,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.48,0:14:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,how wonderful would it be not\Nto remember all that nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.40,0:14:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,this is the power of the memo memo fruit,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.92,0:14:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Germa double six's\Ntechnology; sure is something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.76,0:14:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,despite being shot in the leg, you dragged\Nyourself pretty far—not that it matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.98,0:14:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.76,0:14:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,just paste this memory\Nfrom a soldier who was
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.02,0:14:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,hit by a stray bullet\Nhere and a quick edit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.64,0:14:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.62,0:14:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,that should do it; your memories\Nfrom tonight have all been rewritten.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.48,0:14:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,let's have a lovely\Nwedding tomorrow—shall we
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.70,0:14:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,call the soldiers have\Nthem take her to the ward?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.30,0:14:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,yes, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.54,0:14:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm begging
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.60,0:15:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,you to stop looping that's enough already!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.56,0:15:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,enough already
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.32,0:15:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.04,0:15:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're destroying your arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.02,0:15:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I care?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.50,0:15:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta warn Satya about putting\Nme in evil! She's a liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.94,0:15:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.10,0:15:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.74,0:15:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Lupi! Ow, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.02,0:15:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.00,0:15:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he's going a little too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.56,0:15:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's talk, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.28,0:15:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.19,0:15:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see I'm busy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.72,0:15:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's instructions were for me to obtain
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.10,0:15:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola's whereabouts by\Nwhatever means necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.06,0:15:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So out with it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.84,0:15:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.92,0:16:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd never betray my friends. Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.70,0:16:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess you'll want to be tortured.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.12,0:16:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make it sound so casual.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.46,0:16:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.38,0:16:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to shoot you with\Nthis once every five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.96,0:16:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I will stop when you choose to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.86,0:16:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Something like that could kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.78,0:16:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.70,0:16:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.61,0:16:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Then start talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.14,0:16:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw you, warthead!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.76,0:16:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to go through me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.52,0:16:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.60,0:16:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be done breaking\Nmy arms in just a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.38,0:16:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.29,0:16:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that either!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.28,0:16:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit being a baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.00,0:16:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is anyone in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.68,0:16:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.78,0:16:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were forbidden\Nfrom entering the castle anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.28,0:16:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This island is ascending into chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.16,0:16:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it has reached you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.48,0:16:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you can forgive me for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.40,0:16:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now 5,000 bricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.54,0:16:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.64,0:17:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.76,0:17:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you rest up for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.74,0:17:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbei!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.18,0:17:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Luffy! Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.32,0:17:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Great timing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.48,0:17:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.10,0:17:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you were taken captive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.38,0:17:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm relieved to see that you're well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.68,0:17:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We have catching up to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.98,0:17:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, you must escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.70,0:17:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.46,0:18:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She got here in bad shape, but\Nevidently it's already healing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.18,0:18:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Her skin is tough, and it\Nheals unnaturally fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.62,0:18:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Jerma's augmented humans are\Na marvel, to say the least.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.82,0:18:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe she'll recover in time for\Ntomorrow's tea party after a good night's rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.78,0:18:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She should be in the clear,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.58,0:18:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,but monitor her vitals overnight\Nalso, please notify the vinsmokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.12,0:18:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely they'll be worried, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.12,0:18:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be at the medical\Ncenter on the fourth floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.72,0:18:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, there's plenty of wounded\Nsoldiers in the Shit tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.42,0:18:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt I'll be able to\Nfind the time to sleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.08,0:18:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,thank you for your service, take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.38,0:19:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.18,0:19:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.52,0:19:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I hurt my leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.30,0:19:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you recall how you got\Nhurt, or what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.78,0:19:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember walking around the castle,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.58,0:19:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and then came across some soldiers\Nwho were shouting about intruders.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.20,0:19:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I must have gotten involved somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.58,0:19:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Reizhu, think harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.94,0:19:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.46,0:19:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Your memories were overwritten.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.42,0:19:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fill you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.50,0:19:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But let me warn you,\Nthe truth is damn ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.90,0:19:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,These books are susceptible to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.26,0:19:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're going to torch\Nthe cage with us inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.88,0:19:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave the enclosure before\Nyou're engulfed in flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.94,0:20:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really quite simple.\NDo it then! Go! That quick?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.36,0:20:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm not on board yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.56,0:20:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we're gonna get incinerated!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.70,0:20:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.40,0:20:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn! Lupus! Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.36,0:20:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We're free now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.98,0:20:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.32,0:20:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I feel like I've been\Nthrough something like this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.22,0:20:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You survived. Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.18,0:20:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of you, I didn't\Nhave to rip my hands off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.06,0:20:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.00,0:20:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It just struck me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.18,0:20:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember the first\Ntime we met each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.02,0:21:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Coincidentally, it was also in a prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.62,0:21:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And look, that very same cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.92,0:21:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,also held all these\Nprisoners within its pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.40,0:21:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The world of books is as\Ninfinite as your own imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.60,0:21:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Do take note that Big Mom's allies\Nand lackeys are quite formidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.48,0:21:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch, Chimbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.76,0:21:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what are you doing here? Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.80,0:21:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a bit complicated,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.46,0:21:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but as Captain of the Sun Pirates, I have\Nan affiliation with Big Mom and her crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.92,0:21:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.06,0:21:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what about all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.02,0:21:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose you'd call it a rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.82,0:21:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No turning back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.12,0:21:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.68,0:21:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about your responsibilities?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.42,0:21:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't that an issue?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.94,0:21:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I have cast them aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.14,0:21:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The screams came from the prison library.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.18,0:21:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on? Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.08,0:22:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.28,0:22:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Not surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.32,0:22:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They're quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.23,0:22:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We must find a place to conceal ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.92,0:22:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, they draw close. Good call.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.86,0:22:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.58,0:22:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So we can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.70,0:22:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Too hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.02,0:22:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,At a time like this? Truly? Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.28,0:22:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy burns out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.50,0:22:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He expends energy three\Ntimes faster than others.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.66,0:22:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.76,0:22:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't say I needed to eat. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.44,0:22:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, your stomach speaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.28,0:22:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ignore it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.00,0:22:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.72,0:22:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't eat anything unless you cook it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.20,0:22:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I get hungry,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.34,0:22:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,even if spears or swords or stones rain\Ndown on me, I'll keep waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.32,0:22:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Jinbei, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.36,0:23:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The, uh, truth is, I met with\NSanji, and he proposed to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.28,0:23:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason why we're not\Ngetting married is because
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.10,0:23:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,that love-born fool played\Nright into my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.04,0:23:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And during the wedding ceremony, I\Nplanned to shoot him full of holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.96,0:23:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Things are pretty bad as is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.96,0:23:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We were all tricked by\Nthem, Sanji included.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.84,0:23:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to warn him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.82,0:23:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Look after Nami, Jinbei!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.24,0:23:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a word of caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.18,0:23:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There are many guards outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.06,0:23:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, you're not fully\Nrecovered. Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.78,0:23:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You went through a lot this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.58,0:23:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.48,0:23:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Think I'm lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.30,0:23:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.64,0:24:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you would never mislead me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.64,0:24:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wary of Pudding, but didn't\Nimagine her to be this devious.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.44,0:24:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I had my suspicions.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.16,0:24:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,She just seemed a little too perfect for\Nme, so I thought I should eavesdrop a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.52,0:24:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I really screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.64,0:24:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I assumed if I accepted the marriage,\Nthey would spare my crewmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.58,0:24:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It turns out that was never in the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.26,0:24:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It was all a ploy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.08,0:24:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course they were blowing smoke up
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.26,0:24:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.17,0:24:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought everything would work\Nout if I took one for the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.98,0:24:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of a fantasy was
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.84,0:24:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I living in?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.75,0:24:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known better.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.08,0:24:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They fooled our father, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.16,0:24:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a wise man, But he was\Nundone by his arrogance.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.90,0:24:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dealing with an emperor; he\Nshould have been more cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.32,0:24:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's far too late—this\Nstill might play out for the best,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.04,0:24:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,though I believe that\NGerma should be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.20,0:25:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to pretend I'm ignorant
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.72,0:25:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and let Big Mom carry out her plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.36,0:25:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.40,0:25:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,stupid They'll kill\Nyou tomorrow too, Race!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.64,0:25:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, is my little brother concerned for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.70,0:25:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave the past where it\Nlies, where beyond that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.00,0:25:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't owe me a single thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.88,0:25:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I only helped you once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.56,0:25:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Go find the Straw Hats and leave\Nthis island, Sanji. Like how?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.46,0:25:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.72,0:25:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think would\Nhappen to the Baratier?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.22,0:25:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Just run.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.13,0:25:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Figure that out after you've escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.62,0:25:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay here and all of you will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.24,0:25:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, you have to live\Nfor our mother's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.40,0:25:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why bring her up?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.90,0:25:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Because there's one memory I can't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.32,0:25:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.20,0:26:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What memory?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.04,0:26:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a fight between our parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.28,0:26:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just a child at the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.12,0:26:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,so I didn't understand the catalyst of our
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.54,0:26:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,mother's resentment of\Nfather until much later.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.62,0:26:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's obvious in retrospect.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.94,0:26:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,While our mother was still\Ncarrying the four of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.86,0:26:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,she was quite adamant against turning you
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.96,0:26:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,quadruplets into cold-blooded\Nkilling machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.12,0:26:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.38,0:26:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I am. Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.14,0:26:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you do that to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.98,0:26:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.89,0:26:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The surgery is already arranged.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.32,0:26:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.38,0:26:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,These are my children as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.36,0:26:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you! Please, Judge!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.50,0:26:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,They need their humanity!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.08,0:26:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Being human won't cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.08,0:26:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not when monsters win wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.68,0:26:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Our end goal is to reclaim the North Blue
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.28,0:26:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,by force and restore\Nit to its former glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.68,0:26:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Accomplishing that vision\Nwill take incredible strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.96,0:27:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,which is the reason I give\Nthis gift to my own progeny!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.86,0:27:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop take her away
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.22,0:27:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They forced the surgery on her
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.50,0:27:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But our mother took a toxin attempting\Nto foil our father's plan he was furious
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.76,0:27:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,no what did you just do it was a\Npowerful drug strong enough to affect
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.80,0:27:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,the manipulated bloodline elements\Nunfortunately it wasn't enough
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.04,0:27:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,it didn't take long before superhuman like
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.84,0:27:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,abnormalities began\Nappearing in our brother's
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.08,0:28:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Bodies the operation was a great success\Nwonderful I'm delighted to report
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.94,0:28:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,that their genetic blueprints were not\Naltered in any which way by the toxin
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.50,0:28:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,you wanna play master sanji on\Nthe other hand is trailing behind
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.78,0:28:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll monitor the boy perhaps\Nhis development is a bit delayed
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.80,0:28:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You two must be hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.10,0:28:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.08,0:28:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.34,0:28:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it good?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.50,0:28:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.08,0:29:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Sanji is feeding animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.74,0:29:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He was supposed to be\Ndevoid of emotions! Saru!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.54,0:29:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You were growing, but\Nnot as father wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.74,0:29:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You had compassion.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.92,0:29:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.83,0:29:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,our mother got weaker and weaker due to\Nthe long-term effects caused by the poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.10,0:29:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,She died because of me, then?\NNonsense. Don't think that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.56,0:29:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother? Reiju!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.30,0:29:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.22,0:29:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How's your father treating you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.08,0:29:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing that he wants\Nto do is make us train.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.00,0:29:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.32,0:29:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's only happy when Ichiji,\NNiji and Yonji get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.54,0:29:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I see what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.98,0:29:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.44,0:29:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji cooked me a meal all by himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.24,0:29:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow really.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.20,0:30:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess what Sanji told me\Ntoday that boy. It's so sweet
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.98,0:30:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He said, get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.82,0:30:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the best son ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.22,0:30:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.84,0:30:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.46,0:30:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Flowers for the dead is a pointless rite.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.42,0:30:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're proving your uselessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.68,0:30:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop your crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.08,0:30:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.99,0:30:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.34,0:30:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.10,0:30:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You too, Reiju.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.30,0:30:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.20,0:31:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Our father's beliefs were\Ncompletely contrary to our mother's.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.00,0:31:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why he could never\Naccept who you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.80,0:31:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He blamed you for\Neverything that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.52,0:31:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He lashed out at you as punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.24,0:31:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.28,0:31:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ever cook again!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.24,0:31:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pulling back!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.70,0:31:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.58,0:31:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How is Sanji such a worthless failure?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.08,0:31:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Failure! Failure!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.08,0:31:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.94,0:31:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.04,0:31:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though Mother has passed,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.70,0:31:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,she's still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.70,0:31:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Her kindness lives on in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.30,0:32:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Needless to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.74,0:32:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,you are no failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.84,0:32:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just remember, our Mother\Nselflessly gave her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.76,0:32:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,to protect you and your humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.24,0:32:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the future Mother wanted to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.42,0:32:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you're kinder\Nand more tender than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.54,0:32:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Find Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.76,0:32:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Which way did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.50,0:32:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He escaped the underground prison library\Nand passed through the first floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.52,0:32:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.44,0:32:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Head to the second floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.32,0:32:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.92,0:32:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.42,0:32:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean there's another problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.24,0:32:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there are reports that Boss\NJinbei's in the castle. Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.64,0:32:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's rebelling?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.84,0:32:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it seems so.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.28,0:32:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.19,0:32:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Send this message to\Nthe troops. Yes, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.70,0:33:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow's a big day.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.22,0:33:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't disappoint Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.54,0:33:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.50,0:33:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what will happen if we fail?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.02,0:33:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked a simple question.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.54,0:33:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What'll happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.90,0:33:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even want to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.86,0:33:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.86,0:33:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Considering that lesser inconveniences\Nhave sent Mama into one of her mood swings,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.12,0:33:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,we can't risk sabotaging tomorrow's plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.00,0:33:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.66,0:33:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's an easy way to avoid that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.06,0:33:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You think we should lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.28,0:33:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If you lie to Mama, then\Nyou'll be put to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.70,0:33:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.42,0:33:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, we don't need\Nto tell her anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.90,0:33:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If there is no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.32,0:33:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You get what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.26,0:33:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.24,0:33:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on the fourth floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.40,0:34:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Block off all paths leading here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.56,0:34:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Then make sure everything on\Nthe lower levels is in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.08,0:34:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a move on it and\Ntake care of the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.60,0:34:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am. Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.98,0:34:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.12,0:34:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're in a hurry, it might be\Nfaster just to kill them. Do whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.76,0:34:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.68,0:34:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma 'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.72,0:34:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Spit it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.24,0:34:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Saint?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.90,0:34:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Saint!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.00,0:34:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.58,0:34:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.64,0:34:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What is there to think about, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.80,0:34:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,In your heart, what you should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.28,0:34:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just abandon Germa and flee to safety—it\Nrepresents nothing but destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.70,0:34:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Clinging to the glories of the past, the\Nworld would be better off without us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.74,0:34:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,All
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.88,0:34:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,big mom wants is our military technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.16,0:34:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.06,0:34:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,highly doubt she's interested\Nin taking your mentor's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.22,0:34:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,After
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.72,0:35:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,the wedding tomorrow, our father\Nand brothers will all be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.82,0:35:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,dead Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.10,0:35:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's fine They can't\Ncarry out the threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.74,0:35:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Glorified murderers.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.94,0:35:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what our family has always been.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.18,0:35:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You know I can't stand all\Nthose pretentious jerks!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.18,0:35:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But why do you have to die, Reizhu?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.22,0:35:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have my emotions intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.58,0:35:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But father augmented me, so\NI am unable to disobey him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.20,0:35:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way out, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.70,0:35:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have blood on my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.06,0:35:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I deserve death.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.78,0:35:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, those bracelets on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.24,0:35:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise that they won't explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.08,0:35:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I swap them out for normal ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.50,0:35:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What other reason could\Nbe keeping you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.60,0:35:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.08,0:35:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you pull it together?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.00,0:35:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.76,0:36:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to think about\Nwhat really matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.20,0:36:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wish it was that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.66,0:36:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, straw hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.36,0:36:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, why don't you join my crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.34,0:36:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I could use a cook like you on my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.58,0:36:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nodgy!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.78,0:36:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a good cook, and I need one,\Nobviously—we should be pirates together.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.40,0:36:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.44,0:36:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,have wonderful friends, people like\Nthat—only come once in a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.16,0:36:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Move on!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.54,0:36:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,move on
